{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/geMWEz1FVrfNJU1sJjuli4dTBGi.jpg","belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[{"id":18,"name":"Drama"}],"homepage":"","id":1606776,"imdb_id":"tt35326815","origin_country":["IT"],"original_language":"it","original_title":"Scherzetto","overview":"Successful illustrator Daniele Mallarico travels to Naples to look after his four-year-old grand-son while his daughter is away for a few days. What begins as a simple babysitting job turns into a subtle psychological duel, as the child’s boundless imagination slowly unsettles him. Trapped together in the apartment, Daniele is forced to confront something far more disturbing than a mischievous child: the fear of aging and the loss of creativity. Through this strange encounter, he may rediscover the power of imagination he thought he had lost.","popularity":0.569,"poster_path":"/ym17X80rvFq1mFR50zitgbJoz3d.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":123682,"logo_path":"/2Nk24ubQNCkekarcDEDug0Pc9Z2.png","name":"Mad Entertainment","origin_country":"IT"},{"id":94785,"logo_path":"/u1DBUwYHOPsbTB7ZTqmg2kwfRQU.png","name":"Picomedia","origin_country":"IT"},{"id":155990,"logo_path":"/py9VaywwK6KVi94YwrxSKVg1gkh.png","name":"RAI Cinema","origin_country":"IT"},{"id":120397,"logo_path":"/tj46yUkPI288kHiE9GK5HVjRoOL.png","name":"EDI Effetti Digitali Italiani","origin_country":"IT"}],"production_countries":[{"iso_3166_1":"IT","name":"Italy"}],"release_date":"2026-09-10","revenue":0,"runtime":116,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"Italian","iso_639_1":"it","name":"Italiano"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Trick","video":false,"vote_average":5.8,"vote_count":4,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]}}